<!--
  غاوي — sitemap

  The course and track URLs are listed one by one on purpose. /courses and
  /tracks do link to all of them, but those links only exist after catalog.js
  has run, and a crawler that skips JS would never see them. Listing them here
  is what gets each course its own result rather than one result for the site.

  ⚠️ MAINTENANCE: the slugs below mirror COURSES and TRACKS in
  src/js/catalog.js. There is no build step on this frontend (the files are
  served straight off disk), so adding a course or a track means adding its
  <url> here too. If this ever drifts, catalog.js is the source of truth.
-->
